{"id":"torrey:afflicted-saints","source":"torrey","name":"Afflicted Saints","slug":"afflicted-saints","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"God is with — Ps 46:5,7; Isa 43:2.","refs":[["Ps",46,5,46,5],["Ps",46,7,46,7],["Isa",43,2,43,2]]},{"text":"God is a refuge and strength to — Ps 27:5,6; Isa 25:4; Jer 16:19; Na 1:7.","refs":[["Ps",27,5,27,5],["Ps",27,6,27,6],["Isa",25,4,25,4],["Jer",16,19,16,19],["Nah",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"God comforts — Isa 49:13; Jer 31:13; Mt 5:4; 2Co 1:4,5; 7:6.","refs":[["Isa",49,13,49,13],["Jer",31,13,31,13],["Matt",5,4,5,4],["2Cor",1,4,1,4],["2Cor",1,5,1,5],["2Cor",7,6,7,6]]},{"text":"God preserves — Ps 34:20.","refs":[["Ps",34,20,34,20]]},{"text":"God delivers — Ps 34:4,19; Pr 12:13; Jer 39:17,18.","refs":[["Ps",34,4,34,4],["Ps",34,19,34,19],["Prov",12,13,12,13],["Jer",39,17,39,17],["Jer",39,18,39,18]]},{"text":"Christ is with — Joh 14:18.","refs":[["John",14,18,14,18]]},{"text":"Christ supports — 2Ti 4:17; Heb 2:18.","refs":[["2Tim",4,17,4,17],["Heb",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Christ comforts — Isa 61:2; Mt 11:28-30; Lu 7:13; Joh 14:1; 16:33.","refs":[["Isa",61,2,61,2],["Matt",11,28,11,30],["Luke",7,13,7,13],["John",14,1,14,1],["John",16,33,16,33]]},{"text":"Christ preserves — Isa 63:9; Lu 21:18.","refs":[["Isa",63,9,63,9],["Luke",21,18,21,18]]},{"text":"Christ delivers — Re 3:10.","refs":[["Rev",3,10,3,10]]},{"text":"Should praise God — Ps 13:5,6; 56:8-10; 57:6,7; 71:20-23.","refs":[["Ps",13,5,13,5],["Ps",13,6,13,6],["Ps",56,8,56,10],["Ps",57,6,57,6],["Ps",57,7,57,7],["Ps",71,20,71,23]]},{"text":"Should imitate Christ — Heb 12:1-3; 1Pe 2:21-23.","refs":[["Heb",12,1,12,3],["1Pet",2,21,2,23]]},{"text":"Should imitate the prophets — Jas 5:10.","refs":[["Jas",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"Should be patient — Lu 21:19; Ro 12:12; 2Th 1:4; Jas 1:4; 1Pe 2:20.","refs":[["Luke",21,19,21,19],["Rom",12,12,12,12],["2Thess",1,4,1,4],["Jas",1,4,1,4],["1Pet",2,20,2,20]]},{"text":"Should be resigned — 1Sa 3:18; 2Ki 20:19; Job 1:21; Ps 39:9.","refs":[["1Sam",3,18,3,18],["2